{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brutally frustrating co-op boat adventure you <i>probably</i> won\u2019t survive. But hey\u2014at least you\u2019ll look ridiculous trying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your paddles (and your patience) and set out on a stupidly long, lava-surrounded parkour adventure. In <i>Paddle Paddle Paddle</i>, you and/or a deeply regretting friend must paddle your way through swinging axes, weird wind, evil slopes, and that one jump you\u2019ll miss at least 27 times in a row ... maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the journey? A legendary, mysterious, possibly pointless prize awaits. Maybe. If you ever get there. Probably not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/dd9bbcc2e20419fd863e8ccfed18c98a.avif?t=1772025074\" width=800 height=172 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your <strong>coordination</strong>, your <strong>sanity</strong>, and your <strong>friendships</strong>. You can either:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo and control <i>both</i> paddles like some kind of multitasking god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or play in local/online co-op, where <i>each</i> of you controls a paddle. Coordination is key. So is not yelling. Too much.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/aafe979914e4f08bdf368df92b700864.avif?t=1772025074\" width=800 height=172 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based paddling</strong> like in real life (sort of. not really.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Frustration\u2122 factor</strong> (rage-quitting is a feature, not a bug)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Co-op</strong> \u2014 destroy friendships <i>from anywhere!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Timer</strong> \u2014 for those who <i>hate</i> themselves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One giant handcrafted level</strong> with wacky biomes and checkpoint options (toggle them in Settings!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Input Rebinding</strong> \u2014 because your keyboard will suffer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settings with mercy</strong> \u2014 toggle checkpoints, fix controls, or just cry a little</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/1576d6382c04fd8e5ade755cf900197a.poster.avif?t=1772025074\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/1576d6382c04fd8e5ade755cf900197a.webm?t=1772025074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/1576d6382c04fd8e5ade755cf900197a.mp4?t=1772025074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/ee252496051099a022755ca8b377df19.avif?t=1772025074\" width=800 height=172 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I\u2019m Mateo \u2014 I\u2019m 22 and I made this game entirely solo. The idea came to me in the shower (where all great ideas are born), and I decided to smash together physics-based paddling with a rage-inducing platformer. The whole project was a wild experiment made in under a month.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you have <i>some</i> fun with it... and just the right amount of screaming.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Park","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/c415ea56944721f37761fe3b25c26892d3bc3c5e.jpg"},{"name":"The Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/a1f8aedd60b69ff28b84ec1f850351355a83c787.jpg"},{"name":"The Pipes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/6d70ac66ded12fbf7e3983becfc14c576bb1b820.jpg"},{"name":"The City","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/24f0107c4e88e8d5df17a268fef9fc609e7233b7.jpg"},{"name":"The Ocean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/e6c116627c550e9f7f5933f4d15996bcacae4aac.jpg"},{"name":"The Jungle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/e7e3defb6e0fd71372bd844ade91ac90f5521f8c.jpg"},{"name":"The Vulcano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/f6a264f096245b4e9c3f2af77b47a7151678bfab.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/d3d8cc5f97a7118c24a42bfa6d66bf93875a2f0d.jpg"},{"name":"Paddle Faster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/33b52851d83a41abec669dc87c159a1b8e19be8b.jpg"},{"name":"Paddle Paddle Paddle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3570070/88b66c952a0547b4bfac458f7150d1e30ee3fc26.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570070?t=1772025074","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/2a839f557cfa631abc57800c5ca6724e1f6f0410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772025074","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/36c0ba452988fc4f0555fac3423087011afe775f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772025074","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/36c0ba452988fc4f0555fac3423087011afe775f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772025074","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brutally frustrating co-op boat adventure you <i>probably</i> won\u2019t survive. But hey\u2014at least you\u2019ll look ridiculous trying.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your paddles (and your patience) and set out on a stupidly long, lava-surrounded parkour adventure. In <i>Paddle Paddle Paddle</i>, you and/or a deeply regretting friend must paddle your way through swinging axes, weird wind, evil slopes, and that one jump you\u2019ll miss at least 27 times in a row ... maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the journey? A legendary, mysterious, possibly pointless prize awaits. Maybe. If you ever get there. Probably not. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570070/extras/dd9bbcc2e20419fd863e8ccfed18c98a.avif?t=1772